# Enveloped in Darkness (sandoria 85, RDM AF2): Curilla in Chateau d'Oraguille, Sharzalion in Southern San d'Oria,
# Pagisalis in Northern San d'Oria, qm8 and the Treasure Chest in the Crawlers' Nest. An RDM 50 with The Crimson Trial
# completed: a trade while available (nothing); Curilla's 94 declined (Prog 1), 95 declined, 95 taken (begun, the Old
# Pocket Watch). Prog 1: Curilla's 92 (an Event: her script's 530 on the next talk), Sharzalion's 68, qm8 (nil: its
# default), Pagisalis's 48 (then his script's 564), a bone chip (nil), the velvet (37: Prog 2, the velvet taken, the
# watch deleted, the Old Boots), his 58. Sharzalion's 69, Curilla's 101 (Prog 3), her 107. qm8 with the boots but no
# blood (SOMEONE_HAS_BEEN_DIGGING_HERE); the Treasure Chest's own script gives the Crawler Blood (it reads Prog and
# Time); qm8's 4 declined, 4 taken (Time = now + 30, both key items deleted, YOU_BURY_THE); EQUIPMENT_NOT_PURIFIED; a
# JST day later (the wall clock moves only with `wait jst`) 5 (completed: Warlock's Boots, fame +20); qm8 then (no
# section: its default).
# Curilla's, Sharzalion's and Pagisalis's scripts always start an event (530, 15, 564 here); the quest's Event-priority
# replies alternate with them per NPC (interaction_lookup's UseFallback, a local var cleared by zoning); Progress replies
# always win. qm8 has no script; its default is SOMEONE_HAS_BEEN_DIGGING_HERE. No Sandy mission is current (the five
# that name Curilla stay silent). Curilla's script has no onTrade.
lists ChateauDoraguille/Curilla/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/Curilla/onTrade ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/94 ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/95 ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/101 SouthernSanDoria/Sharzalion/onTrigger CrawlersNest/qm8/onTrigger CrawlersNest/onEventFinish/4 CrawlersNest/onEventFinish/5 NorthernSanDoria/Pagisalis/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Pagisalis/onTrade NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/37
char zone=ChateauDoraguille pos=29.2,0,1.1 job=RDM lvl=50
quest Sandoria.TheCrimsonTrial completed
item BoneChip
item SquareOfVelvetCloth
item NestChestKey
login
trigger Curilla                           # Prog 0: 94
finish                                    # option 0: Prog 1 (declined)
trade Curilla BoneChip x1                 # available: no trade handler (her script has none): nothing
trigger Curilla                           # Prog 1: 95
finish                                    # option 0: nothing
trigger Curilla                           # 95
finish option=1                           # begun, the Old Pocket Watch
trigger Curilla                           # accepted, Prog 1: 92 (Event)
finish
trigger Curilla                           # the script's turn: 530
finish
warp 96.4,0,111.6 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Sharzalion                        # Prog 1: 68
finish
warp 58.9,0.4,69 CrawlersNest
trigger qm8                               # Prog 1: nil; SOMEONE_HAS_BEEN_DIGGING_HERE (its default)
warp 138.6,6.5,133.7 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Pagisalis                         # Prog 1: 48 (Event)
finish
trigger Pagisalis                         # the script's turn: 564 (fame level 1, Undying Flames not offered)
finish
trade Pagisalis BoneChip x1               # not exactly the velvet: nil; his script: no Undying Flames, nothing
trade Pagisalis SquareOfVelvetCloth x1    # 37
finish                                    # Prog 2, the velvet taken, the watch deleted, the Old Boots
trigger Pagisalis                         # Prog 2: 58
finish
warp 96.4,0,111.6 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Sharzalion                        # Prog 2: 69
finish
warp 29.2,0,1.1 ChateauDoraguille
trigger Curilla                           # Prog 2: 101
finish                                    # Prog 3
trigger Curilla                           # Prog 3: 107 (Event)
finish
warp 58.9,0.4,69 CrawlersNest
trigger qm8                               # Prog 3, no Time, the boots but no blood: SOMEONE_HAS_BEEN_DIGGING_HERE
tick 13000                                # the chest placed
trigger Treasure_Chest                    # walks to the chest (its own script)
trade Treasure_Chest NestChestKey x1      # the chest's script: Prog >= 2, Time 0, no blood: the chest opens for the Crawler Blood
tick 4500                                 # the Crawler Blood
trigger qm8                               # the blood and the boots: 4
finish                                    # option 0: nothing
trigger qm8                               # 4
finish option=1                           # Time = now + 30; the blood and the boots deleted; YOU_BURY_THE
trigger qm8                               # Time not reached: EQUIPMENT_NOT_PURIFIED
wait jst=1
trigger qm8                               # Time reached: 5
finish                                    # completed: Warlock's Boots, fame +20
trigger qm8                               # completed: no section; SOMEONE_HAS_BEEN_DIGGING_HERE
